    <string name="privacy_notice_title">Privacy notice</string>
    <string name="privacy_notice_text">This app is run by [school name] to keep children safe on school transport.\n\nWhat we keep: your name and email; your child\'s name, grade, route, vehicle, pick-up point and times; pick-up and drop-off records; and bus chat messages.\n\nBus location: the driver\'s phone shares the bus location only while a trip is running. It is removed when the trip ends, and no location history is kept.\n\nWho can see it: you see only your own children and the bus they ride. Drivers see only the children on their bus. School transport staff see all records. Staff phone numbers are not shown to parents; use the bus chat.\n\nHow long: trip and attendance records are kept for [retention period] and then deleted.\n\nYour rights: you can ask [contact email] for a copy of your data, to correct it or to delete your account.</string>

